BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ekadashi (Krishna) — Ashvina / एकादशी (कृष्
 ण) — आश्विन
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261105
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261106
DTSTAMP:20261103T045158Z
UID:ekadashi-2026-11-05@dharmasetu
CATEGORIES:ekadashi
DESCRIPTION:Why: twice a lunar month\, step back from heavy food and hurry
  — make space for attention.\n\nStory: Ekadashi is the 11th tithi of eac
 h fortnight — a Vaishnava fasting day for restraint\, prayer and digesti
 on-rest.\nSource: Padma Purana ekadashi mahatmya\; Smriti\nWhy: twice a lu
 nar month\, step back from heavy food and hurry — make space for attenti
 on.\nModern angle: Intermittent fasting shows metabolic and microbiome lin
 ks in peer-reviewed work\; ekadashi as a named practice is cultural.\nEvid
 ence: Plausible\nLink: https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10894978/
 \nMore: https://saumya-sharma.github.io/dharmasetu/review/reasoning.htm
 l#ekadashi-fasting\nLocation basis: New Delhi. City-specific timing coming
  later.
LOCATION:New Delhi\, India (reference)
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://saumya-sharma.github.io/dharmasetu/review/calendar.html#ca3
 253e5e4c50755
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dev Uthani Ekadashi / देव उठनी एकादशी
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261121
DTSTAMP:20261103T045158Z
UID:dev_uthani-2026-11-20@dharmasetu
CATEGORIES:festivals\,ekadashi
DESCRIPTION:Why: close the monsoon retreat of the gods and reopen the seas
 on of household beginnings.\n\nStory: Dev Uthani (Prabodhini) Ekadashi in 
 Kartika Shukla ends Chaturmas — Vishnu is said to awaken\; marriages and
  auspicious starts resume.\nSource: Padma Purana / Vaishnava ekadashi lore
 \nWhy: close the monsoon retreat of the gods and reopen the season of hous
 ehold beginnings.\nModern angle: Calendar bookkeeping for social life afte
 r monsoon\; cultural. Ekadashi fasting has broader metabolic research link
 s.\nEvidence: Plausible\nLink: https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10
 894978/\nMore: https://saumya-sharma.github.io/dharmasetu/review/reason
 ing.html#ekadashi-fasting\nLocation basis: New Delhi. City-specific timing
  coming later.
LOCATION:New Delhi\, India (reference)
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://saumya-sharma.github.io/dharmasetu/review/calendar.html#252
 e1ecd88f84577
END:VEVENT
